  "prefLabel": "Ed 1128.05 Calculation of Cost of Special Education",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1128.05 Calculation of Cost of Special Education. The cost of special education for a particular child with a disability shall equal the costs entered into NHSEIS under Ed 1128.04(a)(1) – (7), less contributed funds entered into NHSEIS under Ed 1128.04(a)(8).\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17; ss by #12601, eff 8-9-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
